<title>POLAND: BUDIMEX JULY NET RISES TO PLN 2.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>BUDIMEX JULY NET RISES TO PLN 2.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.50 vs   1.04</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.72 vs   1.34</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.73 vs   0.70 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   52.66 vs  23.19</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.48 vs  11.50</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.75 vs  12.11</p>
<p> Operating profit     6.32 vs   3.82</p>
<p> Sales		  231.67 vs 144.24</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish builder is Budimex SA</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
